# holeclear.sm -- A lid over a wall it clears by a hole
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A narrow wall stands up to the lid, which runs on past it, under a
# hole in the lid: the two would touch at the top of the wall, but the
# hole leaves air there.
sheet 1 1 0.44
plate base 2 2 48 48 origin 0 50 0 axes +x -y
flange left base -x -90 47 span 20 22
flange right base +x -90 46
flange lid right +x -90 51
hole 3 0.5 29 along z at 49.5 depth 1
